    {% set class = 'col-sm-9' %}
    {% else %}
    {% set class = 'col-sm-12' %}
    {% endif %}
    <div id="content" class="{{ class }}">{{ content_top }}
    <div class="container text-black">
         <div class="row">
             <div class=" col-md-12 col-sm-12 mt-5">
                 The Autochair Smart Lifter is a
compact and reliable solution for
lifting wheelchairs and mobility
scooters safely into your vehicle. It
allows users and carers to load
mobility equipment with minimal
physical effort, making every day
travel easier and safer while helping
to maintain independence. It is
compatible with a wide range of
vehicles and mobility devices, and
our team will quickly check whether
it is suitable for your exact setup.
Simply complete the form below and we will confirm compatibility, pricing options and next
steps for you.
                   </div>
  </div>
                 
